[01:08.20]Falling weak on my knees, summon the strength Of mayhem
[01:08.20]无力地跪下，呼唤毁灭的力量
[02:02.30]I am the storm that is approaching
[02:02.30]我即是那迫近的风暴
[02:08.00]Provoking black clouds in isolation
