[02:15.10]我要收回我的真名
[02:21.15]Born in flames, I have been blessed
[02:21.15]生于火焰，受尽祝福
[02:24.85]My family crest is a demon of death!
[02:24.85]阎魔即是我的家徽！
[02:28.35]Forsakened, I am awakened
[02:28.35]觉醒时已被遗弃
[02:34.10]A phoenix's ash in dark divine
[02:34.10]凤凰的余烬在黑暗神灵旁飘落
[02:41.10]Descending misery
[02:41.10]苦难降临
[02:48.80]Destiny chasing time
[02:48.80]命运追逐着时光
[03:10.00]Inherit the nightmare, surrounded by fate
[03:10.00]继承了噩梦，被命运包裹的噩梦
[03:18.00]Can't run away
[03:18.00]无路可逃
[03:23.00]Keep walking the line, between the light
[03:23.00]一路步履蹒跚，游离在光明之间
[03:31.00]Led astray
[03:31.00]早已迷失
[03:35.60]Through vacant halls I won't surrendеr
[03:35.60]跨越空虚的礼堂，我绝不言弃
[03:42.00]The truth revealеd in eyes of ember
[03:42.00]余烬的眼中显露真相
[03:48.30]We fight through fire and ice forever
[03:48.30]我们永远在冰火中死斗
[03:54.90]Two souls, once lost, and now they remember
[03:54.90]曾迷失的双魂，如今刻骨铭心
[04:29.10]I am the storm that is approaching
[04:29.10]我即是那迫近的风暴
[04:35.00]Provoking black clouds in isolation
[04:35.00]唤醒樊笼中的乌云
