[04:42.30]我要收回我的真名
[04:48.35]Born in flames, I have been blessed
[04:48.35]生于火焰，受尽祝福
[04:51.50]My family crest is a demon of death!
[04:51.50]阎魔即是我的家徽！
[04:55.30]Forsakened, I am awakened
[04:55.30]觉醒时已被遗弃
[05:01.20]A phoenix's ash in dark divine
[05:01.20]不死鸟的余烬在黑暗神灵旁飘落
[05:08.20]Descending misery
[05:08.20]苦难降临
[05:15.00]Destiny chasing time
[05:15.00]命运追逐着时光
[05:20.80]Disappear into the night
[05:20.80]消失于黑夜
[05:27.80]Lost shadows left behind
[05:27.80]遗失的阴影抛在身后
[05:34.00]Obsession's pulling me
[05:34.00]噩梦驱使着我
[05:40.00]Fading, I've come to take what's mine!
[05:40.00]我要取回那不断消逝的自我！
[06:12.00]Lurking in the shadows under veil of night
[06:12.00]潜伏在夜幕下的阴影里
[06:15.00]Constellations of blood pirouette,
[06:15.00]血色的旋转星纹
[06:17.20]dancing through the graves of those who stand at my feet
[06:17.20]舞过敌人的坟墓，那立在我脚下的敌人
[06:21.40]Dreams of the black throne I keep on repeat
[06:21.40]黑暗王座之梦，我一直重复着
[06:24.60]A derelict of dark, summoned from the ashes
[06:24.60]无处可归的黑暗，自灰烬中唤醒
[06:28.00]The puppet master congregates all the masses
[06:28.00]傀儡师召集了众人
[06:31.00]Pulling strings, twisting minds as blades hit
[06:31.00]牵动提线，扭曲心智，刀剑无眼
[06:34.00]You want this power? Then come try and take it
[06:34.00]“想要力量的话那就尽管来试”
[06:37.40]Beyond the tree
[06:37.40]魔树彼方
[06:43.40]Fire burns
[06:43.40]火焰燃烧
[06:50.00]Secret love
[06:50.00]隐秘的爱
[06:56.50]Bloodline yearns
[06:56.50]血脉的渴求
[07:03.00]Dark minds embrace
[07:03.00]黑暗之心拥抱
[07:09.30]Crimson joy
[07:09.30]深红的愉悦
[07:16.00]Does your dim heart
[07:16.00]这颗黯淡的心
[07:22.00]Heal or destroy?
[07:22.00]将会被救赎或是毁灭？
[07:57.30]Bury the light deep within!
[07:57.30]埋葬内心深处的光明
[08:04.30]Cast aside, there's no coming home!
[08:04.30]抛却一切吧，我们已无家可归
[08:10.70]We're burning chaos in the wind!
[08:10.70]在风中燃烧着混沌
